<title>USA: U.S. Coast Guard probes natgas leak offshore La..</title>
<headline>U.S. Coast Guard probes natgas leak offshore La..</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Coast Guard was investigating reports of an offshore natural gas leak in Vermilion Bay about 40 miles south of Lafayette, La., on Thursday, a Coast Guard spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;We're still investigating right now,&quot; a Coast Guard spokeswoman said. &quot;I understand it's in Vermilion Bay. It started overnight.&quot;</p>
<p>The Coast Guard had no additional information on the suspected leak.</p>
